<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39516" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulmentārĭum</span></b> ,
			ĭi, n.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Any thing eaten with bread</i>, <i>a
				relish</i> (fruit, salt, mustard, etc.),
				<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 58</span></i>; id. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Charis. p. 56</span></i> P.; <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, 22, § 108</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 87, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 15,
				15, 17, § 58</span></i>; <i><span class="en">19, 8, 54, §
			171</span></i>; <i><span class="en">31, 7, 41,
				§ 87</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of <i>the
				feed</i> of birds, <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 10,
			5</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Food</i>, in gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tu pulmentaria quaere Sudando,</span>”
				i. e. <i>seek an appetite by exercise</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 2, 20</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Johan. 21, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
